# Fblthp is on the battlefield, but no opponent was dealt combat damage on Bot1's turn. Bot2 makes Bot1 draw from the
# empty library with Ancestral Recall, so Bot1 loses as usual (CR 704.5b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Fblthp, Impossibly Lost
Black Lotus
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Ancestral Recall
Black Lotus
Island x6

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: U)
Bot1.Hand.Fblthp, Impossibly Lost.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: U)
Bot2.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.LostTo = EmptyLibrary
